  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ælc tíond áge geweald, swa hwæðer he wille, swa wæter swa ísen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every accuser shall have the choice of whichever ordeal he desires (for the accused)—either ordeal by water or by iron.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis accusatus (uel qui alium impetit) habeat optionem, quid uelit, siue iudicium aque uel ferri.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
